  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/66390703af7ed7c0ff2e04a5cd39f4ef833cb3c1.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2c73ad4a756ee6090ce75d169328e9da83ce8b6d.png\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n此資源包無法在原版 Minecraft 中使用。您必須安裝 Hold My Items 模組。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hold-my-items\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dbfb3032a0b4d78e24701cc19f557afe6dba5b17.png\" width=\"280\" alt=\"Image 1\">\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/respackopts\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/62f097d3725f173dfbddb5c261ddc8b1fcd5e6b2.png\" width=\"280\" alt=\"Image 2\">\n  </a>\n\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/66390703af7ed7c0ff2e04a5cd39f4ef833cb3c1.png\">\n</p>\n\n![about](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c23a25019880c315acc125ca53855d1ee9f30631.png)\n---\n此資源包將大多數預設的 Minecraft 物品轉化為獨特且細緻的 3D 模型，為遊戲帶來嶄新且沉浸式的視覺體驗。靈感來自 Oreville Studios 的 Action & Stuff。\n\n感謝 arch1vways 提供核心光影。\n\n所有圖片均由 Beash 的 Atmospherics 模組拍攝。",
